# Changelog

## Version Release

### **Version 5.0.1 (Latest)** – **Security Hardening, Stability & Performance**

- **🔒 XSS Fix:** All remote device info (OS, browser, connection, IP, etc.) is now whitelisted and sanitized on the server and HTML-escaped on the client before rendering in popups, device list, and SOS alerts.
- **🚦 Socket Hardening:** WebRTC offer/answer/ICE payloads are validated before relay, per-socket rate limits protect chat/SOS/location events from floods, and socket messages are capped at 1 MB.
- **🧪 Test Suite Fixed:** Socket tests now authenticate with the session cookie (they previously hung forever) and new tests cover session forging, payload sanitization, rate limiting, and room switching.
- **📞 WebRTC Fixes:** Offer glare is resolved with polite-peer rollback, transient ICE "disconnected" states no longer kill calls, and the long-press leave-call button no longer instantly rejoins.
- **🔋 Battery Alerts:** Reuse a shared AudioContext (browsers cap ~6 contexts; alerts previously went permanently silent after a few alerts).
- **📡 Reconnect Recovery:** Clients re-join their organization/fleet room automatically after reconnecting instead of silently falling back to the public room.
- **🌍 Room Switching:** Moving between rooms immediately updates the device list and user count in the old room.
- **⚡ Performance:** Device info is cached (30s) instead of rebuilt every location ping, GPS jitter tolerance avoids redundant sends, idle detection is time-based, and map popups are updated in place.
- **🌐 PWA Fixes:** The service worker now precaches the full ES-module graph (offline launches previously broke), dead external CDN precache entries were removed, map tile caching covers all basemap providers, and runtime caches are trimmed.
- **🚀 Server Fixes:** Production rate limiting no longer counts static assets (page reloads could trigger 429s), `sw.js`/`manifest.json` are served `no-cache`, graceful shutdown closes Socket.IO connections (previously hung), and SIGINT/unhandled rejections are handled.
- **🐳 Docker:** Fixed the case-mismatch between `docker-compose.yml` and the `dockerfile` that broke builds on Linux, health check now targets `/health`, and the image version label matches the package version.

---

### **Version 4.2** – **UI Overhaul & Broadcast Features**

- **🎨 Modern "Tech Blue" Theme:** A complete visual redesign with vibrant blue aesthetics, modern typography, and glassmorphism effects.
- **📢 Broadcast Call Request:** A "Megaphone" feature allows users to instantly invite everyone in the room to join a voice call.
- ** Smart Chat & Navigation:** Click on any chat message to instantly focus and zoom the map on the sender's location.
- **👤 Enhanced Profile Management:** "Edit Profile" is now fully accessible on both Desktop and Mobile devices.
- **🌍 IP Geolocation Display:** Device info popups now display the connected IP address for better tracking context.
- **🐧 Linux Support:** Improved detection and icon mapping for Linux-based devices.

---

### **Version 4.1** – **Organization Rooms & Optimization**

- **🏢 Organization/Fleet Rooms:** Users can now join specific "Organization IDs" to create private fleets. Only users in the same organization can see each other and chat.
- **🔋 Battery Saver Protocol:** Intelligent motion detection slows down GPS updates when the device is stationary, significantly extending battery life.
- **🗺️ Map Customization:** New Layer Control allows switching between OpenStreetMap, OpenTopoMap, Satellite (Esri), and Dark Mode.
- **⚡ Bandwidth Optimization:** Room isolation prevents the $N^2$ scaling issue by limiting data broadcasts to room members only.

---

### **Version 4.0** – **SOS Emergency & PWA Support**

- **🆘 SOS Emergency System:** One-touch emergency alerts with comprehensive device and location data
- **📱 PWA Support:** Full Progressive Web App with offline capabilities
- **🔔 Enhanced Notifications:** Audio alerts and browser push notifications
- **🔊 Enhanced Audio Communication (WebRTC):** Real-time voice communication among connected devices
- **📍 IP Geolocation:** Additional location data from IP address
- **🎨 Modern UI:** Beautiful, responsive modal for SOS management


---

### **Version 3.0** – **Advanced Features & Performance Upgrades**

- **Enhanced Interactive Popups:** Now includes real-time device details such as battery status, connection type, and more.
- **Activity Logs:** A comprehensive log system that tracks server notifications, connection events, and disconnections.
- **Live Chat Messaging:** Instant text communication between connected devices via WebSockets.

---

### **Version 2.0** – **Major Enhancements & New Features**

- **Real-Time Tracking:** Continuously updates device locations on the map
- **Smart Device Identification:** Automatically detects and categorizes devices
- **Device Connection Panel:** Displays a dynamic list of all connected devices
- **Audio Communication:** Real-time voice communication between connected devices using WebRTC